    {
      "lore": "Mighty heroes fight at the forefront of battle.",
      "name": "Leader",
      "rules": "Before the battle, in the Muster Armies step, for each <b>leader</b> and <b>support</b> unit in your army, you can select one friendly <b>bodyguard</b> unit that unit can <b>lead</b>. That unit will then <b>lead</b> that <b>bodyguard</b> unit for the battle and form an <b>attached</b> unit with it.\\n\\nUnless otherwise stated, each <b>bodyguard</b> unit can only have one <b>leader</b> unit and one <b>support</b> unit attached to it.\\n\\nSee Attached Units (19)",
      "isAura": false,
